The text in this dataset comes from the English Wikipedia and carries
Wikipedia's licence.

  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Some older revisions are additionally available under the GNU Free
Documentation License. See:

  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Copyrights

Attribution and share-alike both apply. The authors of any article are listed
under its history tab; the `url` column locates that history.

The coordinates come from Wikipedia's GeoData extension and the Wikidata ids
from Wikidata, which is CC0. Neither changes the licence of the text.

The code that produced the dataset is licensed separately, under Apache-2.0.
